# Urban Retreat's ability is offered while Birds of Paradise could still be tapped for mana as it is paid (CR 601.2g), but
# whether a tapped creature can be returned is judged once the mana is paid (CR 602.2b, 601.2h). Bot1 activates it and
# pays the {2} with a Forest and an Island instead, leaving the Birds untapped: no tapped creature can pay, the cost can't
# be paid, and the activation is taken back (CR 602.2b, 601.2h, 729.1), the lands untapped and the card still in hand.
# Bot1 activates it again, this time tapping the Birds with the Forest, and returns them.

